NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001269 " - csv_xs   Test with a variety of combinations for"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001270 "\t    sep_char, quote_char, and escape_char testing"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001271 " - quoting  $dbh->do (\"drop table $_\") for DBI-tables ();"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001272 " - errors   Make sure that all documented exceptions are tested."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001273 "\t    . write to write-protected file"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001274 "\t    . read from badly formatted csv"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001275 "\t    . pass bad arguments to csv parser while fetching"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001276 ""
